<div class="calcpad-output">
 <!-- Section properties of a rhombus from its two diagonals: area, $I_x$, $I_y$, section moduli and radii of gyration. -->
 <h1>Geometrical Properties of Rhombus</h1>
 <div style="max-width:130mm">
  <img alt="rombus.png" class="side" src="Images/mechanics/sections/rhombus.png" style="height:135pt;"/>
 </div>
 <p>Diagonals length</p>
 <p>
  Diagonal -
  <span class="eq">
   <var>b</var>
   = 1.414
   <i>m</i>
